From: Stefano Zambon <stefano@elk.audio>
Subject: [PATCH] Fix build with Python 3.13 and recent glibc

PyEval_CallObject() was removed in Python 3.13, use PyObject_CallObject().
Include <sys/time.h> explicitly for gettimeofday() and TIMEVAL_TO_TIMESPEC.

Upstream-Status: Inactive-Upstream [rtmidi 2.5.0 on pypi is unmaintained]
---
--- a/src/rtmidimodule.cpp	2026-10-02 14:54:16.233128162 +0200
+++ b/src/rtmidimodule.cpp	2026-10-02 14:54:16.236128165 +0200
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@
 #include "PyMidiMessage.h"
 #include "pkglobals.h"
 #include <queue>
+#include <sys/time.h>
   
 static PyObject *rtmidi_Error;
 
@@ -94,7 +95,7 @@
     (*outMidi->m) = inMidi;  
 
     args = Py_BuildValue("(O)", outMidi);  
-    result = PyEval_CallObject(self->callback, args);
+    result = PyObject_CallObject(self->callback, args);
     if(result == NULL)
     {
       PyThreadState_SetAsyncExc(self->calling_thread_id, 0);
